      "contents": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-1ed44ce2-9918-477b-b47e-d395ac9937f8\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a75fd0cc-5a95-434f-9446-9c3437149db4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4c52d62d-86eb-47b5-8ca7-da69b4aed7cd\"><b>📢 아카이브 추가 안내 - 「MEMORIES TELLER」</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-36c2c7cd-6144-4e2f-abce-5d8b7c312063\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-762e745d-6498-42e2-a734-70d28ab4e379\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0fb35bf7-16e7-419a-adfd-af827acb5492\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8d90f02c-cb44-449c-a334-64076f85c04f\">5/14(목) 점검 완료 후, 스토리 이벤트 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8e1b2d92-6282-4534-8756-3f83e824a512\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c4c94ae0-3ec0-4e51-bb97-0c6d1863df92\">[MEMORIES TELLER]가 아카이브에 추가됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f4b02370-2059-4d31-85f2-9ce309b256bc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1c978ecc-d426-45bb-82b6-edbdfaef0160\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bde6977d-d30f-4e4e-8e0b-e690ab737ad7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-412a038e-5dae-401d-8472-33cd8b972716\">이와 함께 미니 게임 [NAYTIBA RAID]가 아케이드에 추가되며,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8287408f-2d9c-4d31-8324-fe2e986203f4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2ea88a13-aa02-4018-b056-c5ac6a67be2e\">콜라보 캐릭터 [이브], [레이븐]의 기간 한정 픽업 모집,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-61038020-873f-4071-bc10-0614941c3748\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5cbeca7a-f097-4384-a9f5-0c2634db4dde\">다양한 한정 코스튬도 함께 오픈될 예정입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9990d2b7-d650-4e56-affd-a67486918610\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5c1557d8-7694-4a20-b8db-79503a249e57\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4465d7ba-8e37-4345-aa44-0381d74560a1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2a52f2b6-b908-4c2d-9c94-c220f0748730\">아카이브 잠금 해제 시 획득할 수 있는</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-484e8aa1-1027-4529-a918-c904a84e8315\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2b3d307a-cc38-4146-a582-cffb80b620ab\">SR 캐릭터 [릴리]와 무료 코스튬들도 꼭 수령해 주세요!</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a93c5030-4eb7-49f3-98a1-bbd00b054c5a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d86c635b-ce43-4cb9-ac9a-64d3e8c3143a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-912c010b-9945-4fc3-b87d-08b2b17192a6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-31ac76da-9986-4d1b-9ef5-c6fe82386d51\"><b>✅ 진입 방법</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1450b35a-9221-4424-92b5-061e5a987b16\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1a4e28e1-5056-4332-bb50-bef6a4be2ed6\">- 로비 화면 → 전초기지 → 커맨드 센터 → 회상 → 아카이브</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bf396e6b-5964-4004-a428-c9ccdfcc21f3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8dd809ba-e12c-4069-8b31-611266b9598a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5daf6f2a-03db-40a2-9928-507e661d2902\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7800e71e-c4e8-499b-8890-94ff7d0469d1\"><b>✅ 오픈 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-794b3ced-a155-4bae-8e0e-03696cd6518a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4a77699b-99d4-4f6e-b491-6cb58711e897\">- 5/14(목) 점검 완료 후</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d0bce8d9-7e3d-4439-96a6-591963f6ea4d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2f2a3b08-a53e-414b-87f4-5cc573db0749\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-538d85cb-602c-4d53-a6d5-a6fa38baa64d\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3279ac5d-d07d-4c54-947c-20dfb6d8442b\">※ 아카이브 해금에 필요한 [메모리 필름]은 B-SIDE IDOL 스토리 이벤트 미션 보상으로 획득하실 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-176b1704-8649-42ae-8964-125cb67c48ff\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-37afc318-4bea-46c3-b155-0cebffeecfdd\">※ [메모리 필름]을 사용하여 MEMORIES TELLER를 해금하실 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-1ed44ce2-9918-477b-b47e-d395ac9937f8\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-3b1b314d-cfb1-4693-81bf-9327632e58cc\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-3b1b314d-cfb1-4693-81bf-9327632e58cc\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA1MTNfMTIg/MDAxNzc4NjY1MDc5ODg4.g4JWa5d1OeO6m-PbZIaW8ApqPV38roLkrp_3tQnImJgg.YONFsD-GWpLdGA5nFNVwmph0XIgboRjIullhZ0zmgRog.JPEG/NK%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%94%EB%9D%BC_%EB%B8%94%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%EB%93%9C_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_%EB%85%B8%ED%8A%B8.jpg?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"1200\", \"originalHeight\" : \"5546\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\", \"fileSize\": \"5193489\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA1MTNfMTIg/MDAxNzc4NjY1MDc5ODg4.g4JWa5d1OeO6m-PbZIaW8ApqPV38roLkrp_3tQnImJgg.YONFsD-GWpLdGA5nFNVwmph0XIgboRjIul